2026-07-27T14:07:16.7168970Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:07:16.7170123Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:07:16.7171158Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
